{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54292","headline":"偈 · 洪諲","name":"偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东西不相顾，南北与谁留。\n汝则言三四，我道其中一也无。\n（见《祖堂集》卷十一。\n《景德传灯录》卷十一录此偈，後二句作「汝即言三四，我即一也无」）。\n（《五灯会元》卷九作「汝言有三四，我道一也无」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"洪諲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54292.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54292","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}